\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces LAYA-Vision as used in this study. An image--text pair enters one forward pass: the vision tower is frozen in both training arms; the language encoder and the two-layer decision head are trained, directly in the full arm and through low-rank adapters in the LoRA arm; and the head answers two typed questions, a native choice question over the dataset pack's classes and a binary fake screen. The choice verdict headlines; disagreement between the two answers is labelled uncertain.}}{6}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
